WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Next, we will launch a one-pound package.

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,360
Price it at fifty taels and then open a branch

3
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:04,640
Establish dealer system

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:07,240
You can get this money just by lying down, Brother Fang

5
00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:08,720
I see your new wine

6
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,680
Business is very good, Brother Chu

7
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:12,440
We'll just wait for you. Come on like this

8
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:16,190
Our four original shareholders are here. Brother Chu, tell me.

9
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:17,470
What do you want from me?

10
00:00:17,470 --> 00:00:19,270
Everyone has been wary of me for so long

11
00:00:19,270 --> 00:00:21,870
Especially our younger brother Cheng Yong, so today

12
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:22,990
I'm going to distribute Fenhong

13
00:00:22,990 --> 00:00:29,340
Let him go home and have an explanation for Fen Hong

14
00:00:29,340 --> 00:00:32,180
This Scorpio is so drunk that it’s so popular. Who’s to say it’s not the fourth car?

15
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:36,500
I’ll see you soon, Brother Fang

16
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,980
Isn’t this wine the same as the one from the previous batch?

17
00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:40,020
same batch

18
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:41,540
So what did they grab?

19
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:42,980
It's not the wine you're robbing

20
00:00:42,980 --> 00:00:44,300
It's face

21
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,460
Xie's house sells eight hundred taels per jar

22
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:47,900
I sell it for thirty taels

23
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:49,500
What they bought was not drunkenness.

24
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:53,140
It's the big brother who relieves anger

25
00:00:53,140 --> 00:00:54,140
The sixth car has arrived

26
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:56,500
There are three more vehicles behind that are being installed, so take note of them.
